                  "name": "Heading 2",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "U6HCca",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "#dde2f8ff",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "3. La primera ley: Hazlo obvio",
                      "lineHeight": 1.3333333333333333,
                      "textAlignVertical": "middle",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 24,
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "POVxx",
                  "name": "Container",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "padding": [
                    8.324999809265137,
                    0,
                    0.875,
                    0
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "htmJr",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "#c2c6d6ff",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "El cambio de comportamiento no se produce en el\nvacío. Está influenciado por el entorno que nos\nrodea. Por eso, la primera ley de la formación de\nhábitos es hacer que las señales sean obvias.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.625,
                      "textAlignVertical": "middle",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "s60cWH",
                  "name": "Container",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "qebJl",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "#c2c6d6ff",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Las señales son los desencadenantes que inician\nnuestros hábitos. Cuanto más obvias sean estas\nseñales, más probable será que actuemos.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.625,
                      "textAlignVertical": "middle",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "DcOXw",
                  "name": "Container",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "padding": [
                    1.2000000476837158,
                    0,
                    0,
                    0
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "W81p1",
                      "name": "Overlay",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "fill": "#161f3340",
                      "cornerRadius": 4,
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "padding": [
                        6.75,
                        8,
                        8.5,
                        8
                      ],
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "a203YJ",
                          "name": "Text",
                          "fill": "#dde2f8ff",
                          "content": "No se trata de tener más motivación, sino de\ndiseñar tu entorno para que el buen\ncomportamiento sea casi inevitable.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.625,
                          "textAlignVertical": "middle",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 14,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "rectangle",
                      "cornerRadius": 9999,
                      "id": "oEeQO",
                      "layoutPosition": "absolute",
                      "x": -12,
                      "y": 1.2000000476837158,
                      "name": "Highlight Indicator (Blue Line)",
                      "fill": "#adc6ffff",
                      "width": 4,
                      "height": 84.25
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "k3ycK",
                  "name": "Container",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "padding": [
                    0,
                    0,
                    0.875,
                    0
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "cZacO",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "#c2c6d6ff",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Por ejemplo, si quieres leer más, deja el libro en una\nmesa visible. Si quieres comer saludable, ten comida\nsaludable a la vista. Pequeños cambios en lo obvio\npueden generar grandes cambios en tu vida.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.625,
                      "textAlignVertical": "middle",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
